{"unit_id":"lileilei2023__deepseek-harness-chat-ui#card-zh","repo":"lileilei2023/deepseek-harness-chat-ui","commit":"e07595ba5c4c9dd6145b2f0bd9ebfe6facffc995","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Harness Chat UI 是面向 DSH Web 的 Skill 协作界面：它将客户端 UI 接入会话、工作区、对话、输入触发器和远程服务，并由 profile 补丁加载。用户可以浏览 Skill 联系人、创建拟人化角色与私聊或群组房间，在会话中查看成员，并使用自动化安排房间任务。工作台还呈现交付物、项目文件、终端、差异和浏览器面板，另有皮肤预览与切换。适合希望在 DSH 中组织多个 Skill 协作并跟踪产出的用户；无需额外 API Key，外部 Skill 搜索和安装会访问 skills.sh 与 GitHub。","source":"generated","evidence":["source/client-ui-skill-chat/src/client/index.ts:48","source/client-ui-skill-chat/src/client/SkillContactsBrowser.tsx:1","source/workbuddy-skill-catalog/src/index.ts:337","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
